 <office:body>
  <office:text text:use-soft-page-breaks="true">
   <text:sequence-decls>
    <text:sequence-decl text:display-outline-level="0" text:name="Illustration"/>
    <text:sequence-decl text:display-outline-level="0" text:name="Table"/>
    <text:sequence-decl text:display-outline-level="0" text:name="Text"/>
    <text:sequence-decl text:display-outline-level="0" text:name="Drawing"/>
    <text:sequence-decl text:display-outline-level="0" text:name="Figure"/>
   </text:sequence-decls>
   <text:p text:style-name="P1">Smart Contract Homework 1: </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3">Exercise 1: </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">1)2)3) Code changed, picture submitted, approved by reviewers, merge done</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">https://github.com/Dauphine-Digital-Economics/Class-Directory/pull/41</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">4) <text:span text:style-name="T1">Two reviews:</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5">Kylian Santos: <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://github.com/Dauphine-Digital-Economics/Class-Directory/pull/39#pullrequestreview-3679294558" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link">https://github.com/Dauphine-Digital-Economics/Class-Directory/pull/39#pullrequestreview-3679294558</text:a></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5">Inès Damiche: <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://github.com/Dauphine-Digital-Economics/Class-Directory/pull/47#pullrequestreview-3713303194" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link">https://github.com/Dauphine-Digital-Economics/Class-Directory/pull/47#pullrequestreview-3713303194</text:a></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5">5) It says “<text:span text:style-name="T2">Success! Your current Balance is 90060965245669870 Wei</text:span>”, or 0.0900609652456699 ETH. I currently have 0.901 Sepolia ETH in my MetaMask. It is correct. </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P6">Exercise 2: </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P7"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P8">Part A: </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P7"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P7">1) The decrypted result is the same as the digest.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P7">Transaction number: 0xb6664c387426e0a09a0b51b043f87e051c6d13020882f0f9109e10061eff6919</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P7"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P9">2) <text:span text:style-name="T3">A pair of keys is generated </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">with the RSA algorithm</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, a public and a private key</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">s</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">. The user keeps his private key (connecting his code editor to his GitHub account) and GitHub the public key. The private key allows to encrypt messages that GitHub can decrypt using t</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">he public key </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">(every time the use makes a push to a repository)</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">, then recognizing the user </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">by verifying the signature</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">. The communication is handled by the SSH protocol.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P9"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P10">The public key is given to platforms that are supposed to validate user identity, and the private key is used to encrypt messages directed to these platforms. </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P11"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P11"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P12"><text:s/><text:span text:style-name="T5">Part B: </text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P13"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P10">Transaction number:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P10">0xb6664c387426e0a09a0b51b043f87e051c6d13020882f0f9109e10061eff6919</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P14"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P14"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"><text:soft-page-break/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Image1" text:anchor-type="char" svg:x="3.971cm" svg:y="0.483cm" svg:width="5.874cm" svg:height="13.035cm" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image draw:mime-type="image/png">
